  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f01-offline-construction" name="From one graph edge to its reuse mask" ecgTitle="From one graph edge to its reuse mask" ecgDescription="An undirected PageRank example has thirty-two vertices with nine non-isolated vertices shown. Outer vertex eight reads property eighteen from CSR position eighteen. Positions eighteen and twenty-two touch the same property line. Their distance four produces the Full14 metadata mask 0x00002200 and record 0x00002212 with five ID bits.">
